      <transcript>ZANGGIRA-</transcript>
      <definition>v. i. To be knotted, tied, entangled, entangled in a knot; to choke.</definition>
      <page>1036</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠠᠩᠺᠢᠷᠠᠬᠣ ᠡᠪᠡᠳᠴᠢᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--xu ebedcin</transcript>
          <definition> An ailment characterized by a choking sensation in the throat.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠠᠩᠺᠢᠷᠠᠵᠤ ᠦᠺᠦᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zu ykyky</transcript>
